    LLM: 'Game: Paskahousu. 52 cards, 5 each. Rank 2>A>K>Q>J>10...3. Play ≥ top. 2: universal except A/10. 10/Ace: clear. 4-of-kind: clear. Draw option when stuck. Last loses.',
    Player: "Welcome to Paskahousu. Play cards equal or higher. 2s play on anything except Ace/10. 10s and Aces clear the pile. Four of a kind clears. Pick up if you can't play, or draw and try.",
